Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.71,0:00:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟这东西完全是初次见面耶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.76,0:00:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你哪里不懂?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.89,0:00:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,首先  你懂这段的意思吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.81,0:00:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,呃…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,"打电话给莉依"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.52,0:00:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,喔…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.23,0:00:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,比我想像的更严重啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.98,0:00:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,"tell a lie"是"说谎"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.94,0:00:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那"the last man"呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.82,0:00:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,"最后的男人"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.82,0:00:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.53,0:00:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,所以直译就是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.04,0:00:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,"他是最后一个说谎的人"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.04,0:00:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么意思?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.66,0:00:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,意思是即使世界上的人全都会说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.88,0:00:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他也会是最后一个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.55,0:00:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.09,0:00:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说只要翻成他是个诚实的人就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.18,0:00:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是在说龙斗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.51,0:00:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,咦?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.81,0:01:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,就算世界上所有男人都会劈腿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.02,0:01:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我想龙斗也会是最后一个劈腿的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.90,0:01:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.28,0:01:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,白河同学
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.53,0:01:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们看下一题吧
Comment: 0,0:01:20.83,0:01:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Love You
Comment: 0,0:01:22.08,0:01:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Tender!
Comment: 0,0:01:38.26,0:01:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,咦? 总觉得我好奇怪
Comment: 0,0:01:41.73,0:01:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没有过 这样的感觉
Comment: 0,0:01:44.23,0:01:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,每当感受到你的温柔 为什么呢?
Comment: 0,0:01:47.56,0:01:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我的胸口就会感到难受
Comment: 0,0:01:51.40,0:01:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,相互交叠
Comment: 0,0:01:52.90,0:01:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,逐渐混合
Comment: 0,0:01:54.74,0:01:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,已经无论如何都无法停止了(无法!)
Comment: 0,0:01:57.49,0:02:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,被烟火的光线给照亮的
Comment: 0,0:02:00.66,0:02:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你的侧脸
Comment: 0,0:02:05.67,0:02:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,LaLaLa
Comment: 0,0:02:06.17,0:02:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Love You
Comment: 0,0:02:07.50,0:02:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Tender!
Comment: 0,0:02:09.50,0:02:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,人家正盯着你呢
Comment: 0,0:02:11.92,0:02:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌暧昧 待在我身边
Comment: 0,0:02:14.93,0:02:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,(一直一直 待在我身边)
Comment: 0,0:02:17.47,0:02:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,LaLaLa
Comment: 0,0:02:18.01,0:02:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Love You
Comment: 0,0:02:19.35,0:02:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Tender!
Comment: 0,0:02:21.10,0:02:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是恋爱吧
Comment: 0,0:02:23.60,0:02:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是你让我了解这感觉的
Comment: 0,0:02:26.60,0:02:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,(这是你带给我的感觉)
Comment: 0,0:02:29.36,0:02:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,对象是我真的可以吗?
Comment: 0,0:02:31.02,0:02:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,(对象是我真的可以吗?)
Comment: 0,0:02:32.44,0:02:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知所措又无法更进一步 真是的…
Comment: 0,0:02:35.28,0:02:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,忐忑不安又闪闪发光的现在
Comment: 0,0:02:38.28,0:02:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,逐渐染上可爱色彩的世界
Comment: 0,0:02:41.29,0:02:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Tender!
Comment: 0,0:02:50.02,0:02:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,
